Deikhans develop a special bond with their mounts through training and divine
blessing. This connection manifests as a calming influence that soothes even
the most temperamental creatures, keeping them stable and reliable in the
chaos of battle.

This passive skill activates automatically whenever the deikhan is mounted.
The calming effect reduces the mount's anger, malice, and suspicion, making
it less likely to buck off its rider or refuse commands. The effectiveness
increases with skill mastery and combines with the Advanced Riding skill
for maximum benefit.

The calm mount ability is particularly valuable when riding aggressive or
exotic creatures that would normally be difficult to control. Where other
riders might struggle to maintain their seat, a skilled deikhan rides with
serene confidence.

